Ontology(<https://purl.openfaster.org/sso/spreadsheet-ontology.owl>
Annotation(dc:title "Spreadsheet Ontology"@en)
Annotation(dc:description "An OWL vocabulary for spreadsheet structure -- a raw, structure-agnostic cell grid plus an optional semantic layout layer, independent of any domain. No content curated yet -- see repo README."@en)
Annotation(dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/>)
)
